librustyaxe (0.1.0-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add opt-in per-server TLS public-key pinning and first-use trust for WSS.
  * Preserve the existing connect_ex ABI using a separate secure entrypoint.
  * Report changed peer SPKI fingerprints for explicit client confirmation.
  * Keep verified TLS the default and reject changed keys before application data.

